+ * its I2C pins are also TLMM 6/7, but the panel is a Goodix GT9886/GT9889
+ * (GTx8 register set, coordinate block at 0x824e), reset is TLMM 5, IRQ is
+ * TLMM 125, and the rails are RPMh ldoa13 (1.8 V) + ldob8 (3.3 V).
  */
